    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Jim Gallagher of Corry Estates is delighted to present 18 Maywood Avenue to the market for sale. This is a wonderful 4-bedroom family home located just off the ever-popular Howth Road. The property benefits from a private and spacious rear garden with patio and decking, and a large driveway providing off-street parking. \r\n\r\nBuilt in the 1960's, this fine home provides approx. 127 sq m / 1,367 sq ft of well laid out living and bedroom accommodation. The ground floor comprises of a entrance hall, a living room, a conservatory, a kitchen, utlity room, and guest bathroom. While upstairs there are 4 bedrooms and a family bathroom. Outside, the front garden is laid in lawn with a large driveway providing ample off-street parking. The rear garden is laid with patio, a decking area and lawn. There is mature planting, which makes the spacious garden quite private. \r\n\r\nThe location of this fantastic family home could not be better, with the property being situated just off the popular Howth Road. There are many shops, cafes, bars, and restaurants locally, as well as numerous excellent schools in the area. Nature lovers are well catered for with St Anne's Park, Clontarf promenade & cycle track, Bull Island Nature Reserve, and Dollymount Strand all being located nearby. The area is very well connected with a regular bus connection on the Howth Road, and Raheny DART station being within walking distance. Commuting further afield is made very easy with Dublin Airport, the M50, and the M1 being nearby."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\r\n\r\nReception Hall: Wood floor, understairs storage\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room: 2 x interconnecting rooms with wood floor, fireplaces and access to conservatory.\r\n\r\nConservatory: Bright and spacious conservatory with tiled floor and access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen: Overlooking the rear garden with a range of fitted wall and floor units. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nUtility Area: (Originally part of garage)\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bathroom: With walk-in shower, wc and whb.\r\n\r\nGarage: Half of original still remains, access to utility room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: Located to front, large double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Located to rear, large double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: Located to front, large single bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: Located to rear, single bedroom.\r\n\r\nBathroom: Fully tiled, W.C., W.H.B., and walk-in shower.\r\n\r\nOutside: Large garden to front with driveway and lawn and access to the garage. \r\nPrivate rear garden laid in lawn with patio and decking areas and an array of mature planting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4 Bedroom Semi-Detached Home\r\nUtility Room and Downstairs Shower Room \r\nPrivate Rear Garden\r\nMature And Settled Location\r\nClose To Raheny Village"
      },
